    "explanation": "Formula determinan ordo 2x2: $\\det(A) = ad - bc = 4(x) - (2)(3) = 4x - 6$.\nDiketahui $\\det(A) = 6$, maka:\n$4x - 6 = 6 \\implies 4x = 12 \\implies x = 3$.",
    "quickTrick": "Determinan 2x2: hasil kali diagonal utama dikurangi hasil kali diagonal samping ($ad - bc$)."
